# Butler Routes - Arathi rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 9 confirmed in-band rares and the fixed world
# containers of Arathi Highlands. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not
# up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever game
# data (questie-forever); the data records no loot on any of these nine rares,
# so there are no signature drops to chase. Respawn timers are unconfirmed
# anywhere, so none are stated. Two higher-level rares (Foulbelly, Prince
# Nazjak) live above the zone band and are not covered here. No rare in this
# guide is a giver, ender, or objective of any core-contracted quest; the
# Trelane containers, the Sealed Barrel, the Messenger Bag and satchel, the
# Syndicate Footlocker and the Cache of Explosives are all quest-owned and
# live in the core routes, not here. See
# docs/arathi-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory this guide was
# built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/arathi-rares
title Arathi Highlands - Rares & Treasures
levels 30-40
zone Arathi Highlands
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords arathi, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

